# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Website inquiry delivery (Web3Forms)
#
# The contact + booking-intake forms email each inquiry to the clinic the
# patient selected. Delivery uses Web3Forms (https://web3forms.com) — no
# backend required. Create one free "Access Key" per clinic inbox and paste
# the keys below, then rebuild / redeploy the site.
#
# Copy this file to `.env` and fill in real values. `.env` is git-ignored.
# Access keys are safe to expose in client-side code (that is how Web3Forms
# is designed to work).
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Per-clinic keys — each tied to that clinic's inbox in Web3Forms:
#   Langley  -> langley@agelessliving.ca
#   Victoria -> wellness@agelessliving.ca
#   Kelowna  -> kelowna@agelessliving.ca
VITE_WEB3FORMS_KEY_LANGLEY=
VITE_WEB3FORMS_KEY_VICTORIA=
VITE_WEB3FORMS_KEY_KELOWNA=

# Shared / triage key used when the visitor selects "Not sure yet",
# and as a fallback for any clinic key left blank above.
VITE_WEB3FORMS_KEY=
